DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260602T120000
UID:69fe12b7f6bd012f0066950c@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This workshop will review available options for when you or a 
 loved one depend on assistance for care needs. Whether the goal is to stay
  at home or move into a facility\, this discussion will generate new quest
 ions and highlight necessary points in your decision making process. Prese
 nted by Sarah Vevoda\, LMSW\, elder care consultant and end of life doula.
LOCATION:Beaverton City Library\, Cathy Stanton Conference Room
