DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260621T150000
UID:69f26f5f213814b1b5257bf4@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Two Bass Hit is an instrumental duo featuring bassists Ed Benn
 ett and Shao Way Wu. These two stellar musicians came together in 2017 wor
 king on repertoire and arrangements of music from the Great American Songb
 ook: Bird\, Monk\, Strayhorn\, and many more\, as well as original composi
 tions. Two basses are a great forum for jazz explorations.
