BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Intro to AI [at Bethany Library Annex]
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T153000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T170000
UID:69f2865ec1cf6f9a7588c239@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Curious about AI? Want to know more about Chat GPT? This lectu
 re will introduce some of the basic ideas around artificial intelligence. 
 We’ll talk about how AI is being used today\, what its current limitatio
 ns are\, and how it will shape the future!\nPresented by Meals on Wheels P
 eople. While all are welcome at this lecture\, the curriculum is designed 
 for adults ages 55+.\nRegistration is required.
LOCATION:Bethany Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69f2865ec1cf6f9a7588c239
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
