DESCRIPTION:Join us for an informative community presentation on earthquak
 e preparedness and local seismic risk.\nGeologist Aaron Fox\, Operations C
 oordinator\, Clackamas County Disaster Management\n\, and C\nontractor\, T
 im Cook of NW Seismic\nwill discuss what the Cascadia Subduction Zone mean
 s for our region\, how to prepare your home and household\, and what to ex
 pect in the event of a major earthquake. This free event is open to the pu
 blic and designed for anyone interested in practical\, local preparedness.
