DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260601T235959
UID:69fe7b0de8af4a2f007137be@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Enjoy reading and nature as you walk the Fanno Creek Trail beh
 ind the library. Pause along the way to read page displays from the featur
 ed picture book\, then scan the QR code to enter a prize drawing for the S
 toryWalk® title!\nThe StoryWalk® Project was created by Anne Ferguson of
  Montpelier\, VT and developed in collaboration with the Kellogg-Hubbard L
 ibrary.\nProgram presented in partnership with Friends of the Tigard Libra
 ry\, an independent nonprofit dedicated to promoting\, enhancing\, and exp
