 w to set up an account\, how to navigate your inbox\, and how to send and 
 receive emails. There will be time for individual questions and troublesho
 oting at the end of class.\nRegistration is required and computers will be
  provided.\nThis class is good for those with email addresses who would li
 ke to feel more comfortable and for those who have never had an account.
LOCATION:Forest Grove City Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69efeae1c1cf6f9a75884b21
