BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beginner ESL Class Provided by Goodwill Industries
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260518T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260518T193000
UID:6994ea244a9fd98b7f7eaab4@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:This class is an introduction to basic grammar\, reading\, wri
 ting\, listening\, and speaking skills for students who can read and write
  in their first language. Students will receive a free textbook as a part
  of the class. We will work together to learn new vocabulary\, sentence pa
 tterns\, and communication using simple English.\nEsta clase es una introd
 ucción a las habilidades básicas de gramática\, lectura\, escritura\, c
 omprensión auditiva y expresión oral para estudiantes que pueden leer y 
 escribir en su primer idioma. Los estudiantes recibirán un libro de texto
  gratuito como parte de la clase. Trabajaremos juntos para aprender vocabu
 lario nuevo\, patrones de oraciones y comunicación usando un inglés simp
 le.
LOCATION:Hillsboro Public Library\, Shute Park
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6994ea244a9fd98b7f7eaab4
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Digital Navigator 1:1 Tech Help with Chuck
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T150000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260521T160000
UID:68e015086df9ca153ebe55c8@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get a one-on-one appointment with a friendly\, knowledgeable D
 igital Navigator who will help you find answers to your questions about yo
 ur mobile devices\, personal computer\, websites\, getting started with 
 tech\, and more!
LOCATION:West Slope Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/68e015086df9ca153ebe55c8
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fun for Ones
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T101500
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260519T104500
UID:69d16fcdb6c4ac1fedca3a56@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Welcome toddlers 12 months – 24 months and their caregivers!
 \nAttending Fun for Ones Storytime is a great way to build the bond betwee
 n child and adult.\nIn this program you and your toddler will sing songs\,
  play action rhymes\, and grow together with books.\n20 minutes of playtim
 e for kids and conversation time for adults follows the session.\nThis is 
 the spring session of this program and it runs March 31 – May 19\, 2026.
 \nArrive anytime between 10:15 a.m. – 11:00a.m. to enjoy this program. W
 e understand how difficult it is to be punctual with a toddler. Playtime i
 s just as beneficial as the storytime.\nFun for Ones takes a break May 26
  - September 1\, 2026. Fall session of Fun for Ones begins September 8\, 2
 026.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Community Room\, main floor
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d16fcdb6c4ac1fedca3a56
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Family Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T104500
UID:696829051f01fb76cec5b32e@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us every Tuesday at the West Slope Community Library for
  Family Storytime!\nBest suited for ages 0-5.\nWe will sing\, read books\,
  and maybe even meet a puppet or two!  20-30 minutes of storytime follow
 ed by time for children to play and caregivers to visit and connect. No r
 egistration required.
LOCATION:West Slope Community Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/696829051f01fb76cec5b32e
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
