BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wind Down Wednesdays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260603T110000
UID:69c70d2758f0b64d9e7c0170@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Start your morning off right and join us in the Rogers Room on
  the first Wednesday of every month for a free one-hour intro level class 
 designed to help manage stress and promote well-being through progressive 
 muscle relaxation\, mindfulness\, and deep breathing.Teacher Ruby offers p
 ractical tips for identifying stressors in your life\, implementing simple
  coping mechanisms\, and cultivating emotional survival skills that focus 
 on humor and creativity. Bring your own pillow and/or mat\, wear comfy clo
 thes\, and prepare to fully unwind.\nThis class is open to adults 16 years
  or older\, but registration is required\, and enrollment is limited to 20
  people.
LOCATION:Forest Grove City Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69c70d2758f0b64d9e7c0170
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bilingual Storytime in the Park – Hora del cuento bilingüe en e
 l parque
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T113000
UID:69fe7d40278f7c2f008c09b3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:We are celebrating our 10th year running this event! Meet us a
 t Cannery Square (new location) for stories and songs in Spanish and Engli
 sh.\nThis mostly immersive Spanish language experience is for everyone! We
  provide a camp-like experience with a storytime provided by the library\,
  lunch provided by Helping Hands Food Pantry\, outdoor game and water safe
 ty awareness provided by Sherwood YMCA\, and a craft provided by local bus
 inesses.\nThis is an outdoor venue. Bring hats\, sunglasses\, a blanket fo
 r sitting on. We will have some shade tents.\nEveryone welcome!\n¡Celebra
 mos nuestro décimo aniversario con este evento! Acompáñanos en Cannery 
 Square para disfrutar de cuentos y canciones en español e inglés.\n¡Est
 a experiencia de inmersión lingüística en español es para todos! Ofrec
 emos una experiencia tipo campamento con cuentacuentos a cargo de la bibli
 oteca\, almuerzo proporcionado por Helping Hands Food Pantry\, juegos al a
 ire libre y charlas sobre seguridad acuática a cargo de Sherwood YMCA\, y
  manualidades ofrecidas por empresas locales.\nEste evento se realizará a
 l aire libre. Traigan sombreros\, gafas de sol y una manta para sentarse. 
 Contaremos con carpas para dar sombra.\n¡Todos son bienvenidos!
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Cannery Square (New Location!)
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fe7d40278f7c2f008c09b3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
