UID:68a37eb5709d27410037bb33@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you need some community service hours?  Teens in eighth gr
 ade and up can join us the second Saturday of the month at 10 a.m. to get 
 two hours of community service. Projects may include cleaning books\, doin
 g craft prep or other library projects.
