BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Citizenship Class Provided by SOAR
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260709T193000
UID:69d6a6b5fca21471b7ee9e70@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Thursdays\, July 9 - September 24\nThese free Citizenship clas
 ses are designed to prepare learners for the U.S. naturalization interview
  and exam\, which includes an assessment of English reading and writing ab
 ilities\, U.S. history\, and government. Study ONLINE or IN-PERSON.\nParti
 cipants will:\nStudy U.S. history and civics lessons (100 questions on cit
 izenship exam)\nImprove your English speaking\, listening\, writing\, and 
