SUMMARY:Storytime
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260701T120000
UID:69af4f5db0595799c0a1fe62@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Storytime Wednesdays at 11:00 a.m.\nTime for stories\, bubbles
 \, and songs! Following storytime Mrs. Emily will teach children to identi
 fy and sound out letters of the alphabet and counting basics. Parents and 
 caregivers learn meaningful techniques that will help expand learning expe
 riences at home with your child. Drop in\, no registration required.\nIf a
 ccommodations would help you attend one of our library events or classes\,
  please ask. Our library events are always free!
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69af4f5db0595799c0a1fe62
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tutors at the Library | Tutores en la biblioteca
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T190000
UID:69fbcbbacaf93436005a43b3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Visit the library on Wednesdays from 5 to 7 PM for in-person s
 upport from our tutors. Whether you are struggling with homework or have s
 pecific questions about a subject\, our tutors are here to help you succee
 d. Do not miss the opportunity to take advantage of having a friendly tuto
 r available to you! Call the library at 503 357-4093 or email us at\nlibr
 ary@corneliusor.gov\nfor more information.\nVisita la biblioteca los miér
 coles de 17:00 a 19:00 para recibir apoyo de nuestros tutores. Si tienes d
 ificultades con las tareas o preguntas específicas sobre alguna materia\,
  nuestros tutores están aquí para ayudarte a alcanzar el éxito. ¡No pi
 erdas la oportunidad de contar con un tutor amigable! Llame a la Bibliote
 ca al 503 357-4093 o envíenos un correo electrónico a\nlibrary@cornelius
 or.gov\npara más información.
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fbcbbacaf93436005a43b3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
