SUMMARY:Toddler Fun | Diversión para chiquitos
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260702T103000
UID:69cec9b9dcd22510c03b53b7@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Calling all toddlers (ages 1-3)! Get ready to test out your gr
 oss motor skills at the library. Crawl through tunnels\, jump over things\
 , and dance your wiggles away!\nNiños entre las edades de 1 y 3 años pre
 párense para poner a prueba sus habilidades motores gruesas en la bibliot
 eca. Gatea a través del túnel\, salta por encima de los obstáculos\, ¡
 y baila hasta no poder más!
LOCATION:Cornelius Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69cec9b9dcd22510c03b53b7
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kathak: Classical Dance from Northern India
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260523T104500
UID:69d179d69057005337d27dd3@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:We are celebrating Asian American and Pacific Islander month w
 ith  Kathak\, a dance style from Northern India\, featuring the talent of 
 Shivani Joshi. Kathak is one of the eight major forms of Indian classical
  dance based on scenes from the life of Krishna.\nAt this event you and yo
 ur family will experience the beauty\, expressive\, and vibrant movements 
 based in rhythm accompanied by traditional music of India.\nLearn more ab
 out Shivani Joshi\,\nhere\n.\nEveryone welcome!\nNo registration required.
 \nThis is an all ages event.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Community Room\, main floor.
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d179d69057005337d27dd3
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hula Hoop Harvest: Plant a Skill\, Watch It Grow
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260707T114500
UID:69d18688b6c4ac1fedca4022@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Shanda Button brings her unique talent of hula hooping to the 
 summer stage at Cannery Square.\nAt this event full of thrills and hula h
 ooping skills\, blending movement\, creativity\, and growth mindset\, yo
 u will experience an interactive\, fun\, and joyful program that will dazz
 le you with what's possible with hula hooping.\nThis is an outdoor venue. 
 Some shade tents provided\, but bring hats\, sunscreen\, and a blanket. If
  you bring chairs\, please bring low camp chairs only.\nEveryone Welcome.
 \nAll Ages.
LOCATION:Sherwood Public Library\, Cannery Square\, 22622 SW Pine St. Sher
 wood\, OR
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69d18688b6c4ac1fedca4022
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
