DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260526T130000
UID:69af54c5b0595799c0a1ffd9@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Tech Help Tuesdays 12:00- 2:00p.m.\nDo you want to learn more 
 about using your phone\, tablet\, laptop or other device? Reserve your spo
 t for a one-on-one tech troubleshooting session and bring your devices or 
 use the library computers. You can receive help with creating\, saving\, a
 nd sharing documents\, composing & sending emails\, navigating the interne
 t\, using dictation or text-to-speech\, and other basic computer skills. T
 his is a free program. Sign up for a 1-hour appointment or by calling the 
 library at 503-647-5051 or visiting\nhttps://www.wccls.org/events\nDrop in
  appointments may be available
LOCATION:North Plains Public Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69af54c5b0595799c0a1ffd9
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:My Peaceful Day: Mindfulness and Meditation for Stress Management
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T110000
UID:69b496b9c94c122f19bdedff@wccls.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Discover how to transform stress into resilience through this 
 practical\, introductory class on mindfulness and meditation.  In a world 
 filled with social media and invitations to panic\, this class offers a ge
 ntle introduction to evidence-based techniques designed to help you quiet 
 a racing mind\, reduce physical tension\, and cultivate a sense of inner p
 eace regardless of external chaos.  Teacher Ruby brings over two decades o
 f practice and experience to share mindfulness basics\, guided meditations
 \, stress reduction tools and self-care practices.  No prior experience is
  required.\nThe class is free and open to adults 16 and older\, but regist
 ration is required\, and class size is limited to 20 people. Students are
  welcome to wear comfortable clothing and bring mats and pillows.
LOCATION:Forest Grove City Library
URL:https://wccls.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69b496b9c94c122f19bdedff
X-SOURCE:WCCLS Libraries
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
